WEBVTT

00:04:27.013 --> 00:04:32.518
on the basis of disabilities, 
mental health issues, sexual orientations,

00:04:32.518 --> 00:04:36.188
gender identities, and other features
deemed “not normal.”

00:04:36.814 --> 00:04:40.401
But the reality is that the differences
in our bodies, minds,

00:04:40.401 --> 00:04:43.237
perceptions, and ideas about
the world around us—

00:04:43.237 --> 00:04:46.407
in short, diversity— 
is the true normal.